1200513025,"date":1510798418000,"rawContent":"Q5a: White Privilege &amp; White Supremacy in ALL its forms\n\nQ5b: Resistance is all of the women, Black women especially, LGBTQ, marginalized, voiceless, who run for office, the #BlackLivesMatter,movement,  Standing Rock, \n#SlateReads https:\/\/t.co\/2ARWgXU2t7","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":375,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":937216404532609025,"date":1512284778000,"rawContent":"Terry Crewed is no less deserving of outrage. Sexual harrassment and groping if men us equally disgusting and a crime. Don't be racist. Fight fur Terry, too.\n#MeToo #HimToo #SexualHarassment https:\/\/t.co\/VI3cM1ATVz","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":375,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":939337683939110912,"date":1512790530000,"rawContent":"@docfreeride My heart bleeds anew for you am &amp; for #MeToo. I'm so sorry that this happened to you; that this was made your heavy burden to carry and be altered by. Please do not feel pressure by ANYONE to name him. It yours &amp; ONLY your choice to enter into a potential career-ending move. \ud83d\udc94\ud83d\udc94","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":375,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":939338760939913216,"date":1512790787000,"rawContent":"This THREAD details EVERY SINGLE REASON why women\/people do not come forward when sexually abused or raped. Dr. Janet @docfreeride just gave a Master Class on how abusers get away with it... for decades! Thank you fur your courage, sis. I BELIEVE YOU!\n#MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/u2y21kpUdB","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":375,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":939339981591527424,"date":1512791078000,"rawContent":"@NyashaJunior I am so sorry that this happened to you, my sister. Many blessings for your healing. If you need to talk to someone who gets it and lived it, I am available. #MeToo","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":375,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":949063122404499456,"date":1515109255000,"rawContent":"#BlackWomenMatter\n#BlackWomenLivesMatter\n#BlackMothersMatters\n#BlackMothersLivesMatter\n#BlackBabiesMatters\n#BlackLivesMatter \n#ListenToBlackWomen https:\/\/t.co\/HkZtlBq1TS","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":376,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950514934135205888,"date":1515455394000,"rawContent":"#BlackLivesMatter EVERYWHERE! Bless you Anika and all my brothers and sisters in #Canada! https:\/\/t.co\/6cgynPxHfi","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":377,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950944098646552576,"date":1515557715000,"rawContent":"God bless you, Jules Woodson for coming forward about your rape as a teen by a Pastor. As someone who took over 20 yrs to confront my repeated abuser, I know how hard this was &amp; how vile this response from Savage &amp; church is. You are not alone. \ud83d\ude4f\n\n#MeToo #Silenceisnotspiritual https:\/\/t.co\/1jQ6nlDBzn","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":377,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950949095933280257,"date":1515558906000,"rawContent":"@JustmeDimps This cognitive dissonance is all over America. Men who brag about sexually abusing women getting voted in for President, with 53% of  White women making sure he won. The white church was behind Roy Moore. Hypocrisy is a religious practice.\n#MeToo #ChurchToo #SilenceIsNotSpiritual","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":377,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":11,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950949876719742976,"date":1515559093000,"rawContent":"As a both a survivor of family molestation and rape by a stranger as a child, it took me until 30 to get my voice back. It takes EV.VERY.THING to rebuild what was shattered &amp; stolen. The journey back to wholeness is life-saving &amp; hard AF.\n#MeToo #SilenceIsNotSpiritual #ChurchToo https:\/\/t.co\/mOLDhYDAO2","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":377,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":12,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950976658692980736,"date":1515565478000,"rawContent":"Sharing today abt my sexual abuse and getting the silence from people who say they care about me, is the reason why I stopped sharing it. It always reveals where friends can't be friends FOR me. Being naked, scars for all to see, made sharing feel like rape all over again. #MeToo","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":377,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":13,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950987932516589568,"date":1515568166000,"rawContent":"Having my voice stripped from me by my abusers who threatened me, my life, my family to not tell on them created a split in my being. Having the courage to share is still terrifying. Getting silence back is like punishment for sharing. It hurts.\n#MeToo #SilenceIsNotSpiritual","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":377,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950990043593633797,"date":1515568669000,"rawContent":"I have said very little about #MeToo &amp; me because any memories I share can trigger waves &amp; days of pain, bottomless suffering. There are days I feel like I'm held together by tape, books &amp; amnesia. One memory can blow everything to a million pieces &amp; a good wind can scatter me. 4","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":377,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950992130570244097,"date":1515569167000,"rawContent":"I've allowed the silent reactions of friends &amp; family to cover me in more shame. Like I'm the weird one to be avoided at all costs. I became a Master at hiding in plain sight so others could be in the same room w\/me, the damaged one, and at ease. 5.\n#MeToo #SilenceIsNotSpiritual","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":377,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":16,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950993697713266688,"date":1515569540000,"rawContent":"I've earned each decibel of my voice being heard. I fought myself to not be invisible in front of everybody; to share other things abt me besides my scars &amp;how I got them &amp;what it feels like to have skin made of guilt, shame &amp; longing for death. 6.\n#MeToo #SilenceIsNotSpiritual","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":377,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950994825762910210,"date":1515569809000,"rawContent":"So, here I am, highly triggered, unable to sleep, unable be quiet, stuff my emotions w\/alcohol or food; unable to just disappear &amp; not ever come back *on here* again;\nunable to be ok with\/the silence one more time and saying that. It's HUGE. Wow! 7.\n#MeToo #SilenceIsNotSpiritual","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":377,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":1,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":950996186827141120,"date":1515570134000,"rawContent":"This is so HUGE that I could dance for joy! I'm not eating or drinking to go numb. I haven't run away to hide. I'm talking vs shutting down completely. I'm telling my truth, THE truth, unapologetically, w\/o asking permission. A new day has dawned! 8. #MeToo #SilenceIsNotSpiritual","userId":1078465580,"media":null,"username":"AnasuyaIam",